# Smart Recipe Discovery Engine 🍲

A console-based Java application that helps users discover recipes based on ingredients, cuisine preferences, and favorite recipes. The project demonstrates Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), collections framework usage, and basic recommendation system concepts in Java.

## Features

- User Registration and Login
- Browse All Recipes
- Search Recipes by Ingredients
- Filter Recipes by Cuisine
- Personalized Recipe Recommendations
- Add New Recipes
- Add Recipes to Favorites
- View Favorite Recipes
- Simple Recommendation Engine based on user preferences

---

## Tech Stack

- Java
- OOP Concepts
- Java Collections Framework
- Command Line Interface (CLI)

